# Pijul
# Pijul is the working VCS; git is the checkpoint and distribution mirror. Pijul's
# own metadata is not content and must never end up in a git commit — otherwise
# `git add -A` from an agent sweeps several hundred internal state files into the
# next checkpoint.
.pijul/
